<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ill. Superconductor upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ill. Superconductor upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said it upgraded Illinois Superconductor Corp to outperform (speculative) from neutral.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 3/8 to 16-3/4 in midmonrning exchange trading.</p>
</text>
